data: {"id": "6d7d63cb0b484269-thinking-parallel_evidence-990", "run_id": "6d7d63cb0b484269", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 事实与因果\n\n- **Pod 身份与生命周期**：`aiops-case-v05/workload`，UID `b9e687f5-702b-4d01-bfb9-2df4ff23ba91`，调度到 `node2`。创建时间 `2026-09-11T10:16:10Z`，Phase 始终为 `Pending`，`ContainersNotReady`。`restarts=0`，`Initialized=True`，`PodScheduled=True`。\n- **等待原因**：`kubelet` 报告 `State: Waiting, Reason: ContainerCreating`。\n- **直接根因（Events）**：\n  - `FailedMount`：**\"configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key\"**（对卷 `input`，ConfigMap `workload-input`）。该事件在 33 分钟内累积 23 次。\n  - `FailedMount`：**\"Unable to attac", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789123809328, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

